            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An integrated circuit ESD bus structure includes a circuit area; a plurality of electrostatic discharge (ESD) buses; a plurality of pad groups adjacent and connected to the plurality of ESD buses; a common ESD bus; and a plurality of bonding wires configured to connect the plurality of pad groups to the common ESD bus.</p>
